Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:28.00,H_id,,0,0,0,,"Dia cuma GAGAK tanpa api dewa" ... "Dia phoenix atau bukan, BUKAN urusanmu."
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:28.00,C_id,,0,0,0,,Tonton semua episode GRATIS ▶ YT688.app
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:01.50,S_id,,0,0,0,,Siapa yang izinkan kamu menyentuhnya?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.54,0:00:02.44,S_id,,0,0,0,,Feng Qiwu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.48,0:00:03.50,S_id,,0,0,0,,Karena orang luar,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.54,0:00:08.26,S_id,,0,0,0,,kau berani memukul Phoenix Emas?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.30,0:00:09.74,S_id,,0,0,0,,Sakit, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.78,0:00:11.14,S_id,,0,0,0,,Sedikit saja...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.18,0:00:14.28,S_id,,0,0,0,,Dia jelas-jelas cuma gagak
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.32,0:00:16.08,S_id,,0,0,0,,tanpa darah phoenix, tanpa api ilahi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.12,0:00:17.88,S_id,,0,0,0,,Bahkan auranya beda dari klan phoenix.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.92,0:00:20.08,S_id,,0,0,0,,Sampai kapan mau menipu diri sendiri?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.12,0:00:21.02,S_id,,0,0,0,,Benar, benar!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.06,0:00:21.96,S_id,,0,0,0,,Cepat, yakinkan dia!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:23.18,S_id,,0,0,0,,Semua sekarang bergantung padamu!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.22,0:00:24.58,S_id,,0,0,0,,Dia phoenix atau bukan
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.62,0:00:28.00,S_id,,0,0,0,,bukan urusanmu.
